            <h1>ROBLOX - a kids, parents and family activity site for building toy amusement parks, rc cars, clothing, and electronic devices out of construction blocks that are as realistic as a movie or tv show.</h1>
            <p>This is a description of ROBLOX intended to match as closely as possible the context of a typical ROBLOX page:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>ROBLOX is an educational building toy for kids, parents, families and schools.</li>
                <li>ROBLOX allows kids to build amusement parks, movie theaters, skateboard parks, baseball fields, cruise ships and other sports venues.</li>
                <li>ROBLOX allows children to invent toy cars, trucks, airplanes, pants, shirts, and hats.</li>
                <li>ROBLOX allows children to create and sell snack foods, breakfast foods, energy drinks and fast food.</li>
                <li>ROBLOX allows kids to create items like cell phones, video cameras, laptop computers and tv sets.</li>
                <li>ROBLOX allows kids to explore fantasy worlds like outer-space, castles, jungles, undersea, future cities, and the old west.</li>
